# Contributing

Full process: `CONTRIBUTING.md`. Issue/PR templates live in `.github/`.

- Fork, branch, PR against `main`. Never push to `main` (canary publish).
- One concern per PR. No unrelated refactors or formatting-only diffs.
- Do not bump versions, publish, or edit release workflows.
- Do not add dependencies without an issue. Touch `bun.lock` only when needed.
- Behavior change → colocated Vitest tests. Then `bun run lint`, `bun run test`, `bun run typecheck`.
- Commits: `type(scope): summary` (`feat` / `fix` / `docs` / `chore` / `ci` / `refactor` / `test`).
- Do not skip git hooks. Do not commit, push, merge, or open a PR unless asked.
- Security: private GitHub advisory only. Never a public issue or exploit PoC.
